\section{The configuration form}

[[SessionConfigView]] is the form shown in the launch window. Its layout is platform specific
(Chapters~\ref{ch:visionos} and~\ref{ch:ios}); this file holds the state and the connection logic.
Most settings are stored in user defaults. The three foveated settings are new; the manual IP
address field is shared by both backends.

